    {
      "text": "To enable Hive support in SparkSession or use the HiveContext you will need to add both Spark’s\nSQL and Hive components to your dependencies.\n```\nTo enable Hive support in SparkSession or use the HiveContext you will need to add both Spark’s\nSQL and Hive components to your dependencies.\n```",
