    {
      "text": "\n### DAG\nSpark’s high-level scheduling layer uses RDD dependencies to build a Directed Acyclic Graph (a\nDAG) of stages for each Spark job. In the Spark API, this is called the DAG Scheduler. \n\n- execution of a Spark job is handled by the DAG. The DAG builds a graph of stages for each job,\ndetermines the locations to run each task, and passes that information on to the TaskScheduler,\nwhich is responsible for running tasks on the cluster. The TaskScheduler creates a graph with\ndependencies between partitions",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "871e63300e77499bba51f"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\n\n\ncase class Address(addressType:String, state:String, city:String, mobile:Array[String] )\ncase class Person(name:String, address: Array[Address])\n\nval rameshAdd = Array(\n  Address(\"Peramanent\", \"U.P.\", \"Gramin\",Array(\"91 27287\",\"+551 2222\")),\n  Address(\"Correspondance\", \"M.P.\", \"Pune\",Array(\"91 787878\",\"+120 87773\"))\n     )\n\n\nval skumaAdd = Array(\n  Address(\"Peramanent\", \"G.P.\", \"gkp\",Array(\"91 a11111a\",\"+551 333333\")),\n  Address(\"Correspondance\", \"J and K\", \"Tiahri\",Array(\"91 8398487398\",\"+120 434343\"))\n     )\n\nval personOne:Person = Person(\"Ramesh\",rameshAdd)\nval personTwo:Person = Person(\"Skuma\",skumaAdd)\n\nval data:Seq[Person] = Seq(personOne,personTwo)\nval df = data.toDF()\n\ndf.printSchema\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "4ca9fab857914c3f89258"
    },
