    {
      "text": "###Functions on RDDs: Transformations Versus Actions\n\nThere are two types of functions defined on RDDs: actions and transformations. Actions are\nfunctions that return something that is not an RDD, including a side effect, and transformations are\nfunctions that return another RDD.",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
