      "id": "af66d2d9f7e74498a16fd"
    },
    {
      "text": "###The Spark Application\n\nA Spark application corresponds to a set of Spark jobs defined by one SparkContext in the driver\nprogram. A Spark application begins when a SparkContext is started. When the SparkContext is\nstarted, a driver and a series of executors are started on the worker nodes of the cluster. Each\nexecutor is its own Java Virtual Machine (JVM), and an executor cannot span multiple nodes although\none node may contain several executors.",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "a929ef8b5094452c96c7a"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\ncase class Flight(dest:String, orgin:String, count:Long)\nimport org.apache.spark.rdd.RDD\n\nval flightTypeRdd:RDD[Flight] = flightRdd.map(row => Flight(row.getAs[String](0), row.getAs[String](1), row.getAs[Long](2)))",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "5d413cbf48054dfca6ec3"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\n(\n  wordRdd.partitions,\n  wordRdd.partitions.size,\n  wordRdd.dependencies\n)",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "3deaedda09254a66bb373"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\nflightDf\n.groupBy(flightDf(\"dest_country_name\"))\n.max(\"count\")\n.show(5,false)",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
