      "id": "bfea6f3d79d048899ae66"
    },
    {
      "text": "**`spark-submit/spark-shell`**\n```\n--jars does not include the JAR in the driver’s class path. If this is the case for your cluster\nyou must also specify the same JAR to --driver-class-path.\n```",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "b7b82b435b454a448830d"
    },
    {
      "text": "\n```\nFind out what type an RDD is by using the toDebugString function, which is defined on all RDDs. This will tell you what\nkind of RDD you have and provide a list of its parent RDDs.```",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
